&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/leng-dan-xiao-hua-wei-man-zu-lv-mao-pi-nan-you-shi-tu-cao-kong-fei-zhai-zuo-wei-MVsm/reader/15" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;#15 第十四章-冷淡校花脱离肥宅控制，却发现绿帽癖男友背地里出卖她，自暴自弃决心成为肥宅性奴&lt;/a&gt;
